WEBVTT

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.940
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.590
This is bad, Kitaro!

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.350
If that falls into human hands,
it'll be a disaster!

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.100
Huh?

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.160
How dare you do that after all this time!
I won't forgive you!

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.210
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.670 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:13.180
Up she goes!

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.060
Huh?

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.610
Hey, where's Dad?

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:32.010
You're all I have left, Yuna-chan!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.390
You won't go anywhere, will you?

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.370
You'll be with me forever, right?

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:40.730
Yes, Mom.

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:42.380
Yuna-chan!

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.400
O-Ouch...

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.650
That hurts.

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:53.100
CHAPTER 26

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:58.040
INFATUATION
THE ALLURING GAHI

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:00.910
I'm off to school.

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:03.110
Yuna-chan.

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:07.670
What about today's pool class?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.760
I won't go in, of course.

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:21.120
Yo!

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.190
What do you want?

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.130
I don't want anything per se...

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.950
In that case, don't talk to me.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.360
Is it your mom's rules again?

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:35.370
I should be an exception.
I'm your childhood friend.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:37.040
There's no exception.

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.330
But it's crazy!

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:42.000
"Don't wear a bathing suit
in front of boys." "Don't talk to boys"...

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.750
What is she thinking?!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.260
Mom's insecure.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.760
She's afraid if I get a boyfriend
I might abandon her...

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.570
just like my dad did.

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:55.570
That makes no sense!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:04:00.350
Mom's right. Boys are all stupid anyways.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:01.770
You're the stupid one!

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:02.970
Huh?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:06.650
You're not thinking about
how the people around you feel.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:08.960
That's not your business, Uchida.

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:10.900
Yes it is!

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.300
How so?

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.290
Because I'm in love with you!

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:19.080
What?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.790
I've always loved you.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.880
Please go out with me!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:26.170
E-Even so, I can't just...

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.710
You know it's not possible.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:30.670
Because of your mother's rules?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.180
Just ignore them!

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.680
I can't do that.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:34.640
Yes you can!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.110
I can't!

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.160
N-No!

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:46.120
Yuna!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:55.950
I'm home.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.550
I saw you.

00:04:57.550 --> 00:04:58.910
Mom?

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.560
I saw you kissing Uchida-kun.

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.920
So you're betraying me too, Yuna-chan.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:09.420
You're going to leave me to go to him.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:11.920
No I'm not! He forced--

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.670
Don't touch me! You're filthy!

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:15.890
You're a filthy child!

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.430
You disobeyed me and now you're filthy!

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.580
You're not my daughter anymore!

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.850
Oh no! This is bad! I have to hurry or...

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.000
Heave ho!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.080
Excuse me.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:43.990
Huh?

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:46.170
You dropped these.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.790
Oh! How kind of you!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.420
I'll put them in your basket.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:54.840
Thanks again! You're a real help!

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.910
Thank you, young lady.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.120
Excuse me...

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:10.900
You're filthy!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.190
You're a filthy child!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.480
You're not my daughter!

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.570
How beautiful.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.150
D-Don't!

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.490
She'll say I'm filthy again!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.280
You are filthy?

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:01.620
All my eyes see is an innocent maiden.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:06.930
I broke my mother's rules. That's why...

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:10.890
You are a good daughter
who seeks to obey her mother.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:17.380
I am merely a picture
drawn on a piece of paper.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.720
I am not a human man.

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:24.870
Does being touched by me
break the rules your mother has made?

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:29.660
Do you believe I am filthy?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:33.460
My name is Gahi.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.890
Perhaps fate has brought us together.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:42.970
I would like to stay by your side
until your wounded heart has healed.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:45.700
It's gone!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:46.910
It's gone!

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.000
Where, where, where is it?! It's gone!

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.670
Is something wrong?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.840
Oh, Kitaro!

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:56.900
I can't find my scroll anywhere!

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.220
I see someone's drinking himself silly.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:06.180
Cut me some slack!
Today's the monthly Yokai Market!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:08.640
So you got some <i>sake</i> there.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:10.020
Honestly...

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.200
Y-Y-Y-You didn't?!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:16.570
You didn't go and trade
my scroll for some <i>sake</i>, did you?!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.030
How rude!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.860
I lost that picture somewhere!

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:23.800
You rotten old man! Want me to kiss you?!

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.370
This is bad, Kitaro!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:30.160
If that falls into human hands,
it'll be a disaster!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.120
Huh?

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:35.440
Yo.

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:38.340
Sorry about yesterday.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:40.070
Keep away from me.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:43.220
I meant what I said yesterday!

00:08:43.610 --> 00:08:48.970
I've always, always been in love with you!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.640
What an incessant man.

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.210
Huh?

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:58.070
Yuna cannot be with a human man like you.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:09:00.780
To do so would be to betray her mother.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.780
That's just crazy!
She's not a child anymore!

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.070
Don't be your mother's slave!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:09.240
She does not have to take that from you!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:15.440
If you say you love Yuna,
then try considering her feelings.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.690
This is ridiculous!

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:22.230
Gahi-san.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:28.410
Everyone rejects me
as strange for doing what Mom says.

00:09:28.780 --> 00:09:33.640
You're the first one
who's ever accepted me.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:51.910
My heart is at ease
when I am with you somehow.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:56.460
Thank you for finding me.

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.650
Let us continue on together.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:00.940
Yes.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.700
You've been in a good mood recently.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.430
Huh? Y-You think so?

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.350
I do. Oh?

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:17.770
What is this?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.810
Oh! That's--

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.480
My, what a pretty picture!

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.570
Yeah...

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.260
It's really pretty.

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:35.640
Are you in love, Yuna-chan?

00:10:36.180 --> 00:10:37.080
That's...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.560
You don't have to hide it.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.170
It's no wonder.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:44.550
It's such a beautiful picture.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.720
You're not mad?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.010
Of course not.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.220
Pictures are wonderful.

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:54.030
They don't betray like people do,
and they don't go anywhere.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.520
Oh, look at the time.

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:00.870
Good morning.

00:11:01.630 --> 00:11:02.900
Watanabe-san.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:03.900
Hello.

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:09.780
Gee, I didn't know
you used this station, too, Yamamoto-san.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:13.390
What a coincidence to see you
outside the office.

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.120
I'm lying.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:17.120
Huh?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.040
I heard you use this station,
so I took the long way to work.

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:21.870
Huh?

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:26.190
I want to get to know you more.

00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:41.810
What's wrong? I can see through you.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:44.520
I am a little weak.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.530
I have not eaten anything in a long time.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:49.280
Are you hungry?

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:55.490
Yes. But if you discover what I eat,
you may come to hate me, Yuna.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:57.280
That's not possible!

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.270
I love you, Gahi-san...

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:02.930
You're all that I have.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:06.750
Are you sure your feelings will not change
if you see the true me?

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.440
Yuna!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.630
What are you doing there?!

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.860
Wh-What?!

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:21.430
Human souls.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.440
That is what I feed on.

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.110
Souls?!

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:30.510
I have accepted you as you are
without rejecting you, Yuna.

00:12:31.630 --> 00:12:34.450
You will accept me too, right Yuna?

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:39.220
Yuna, I am all you have.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:45.170
OLD MAN CRYBABY

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:49.670
<i>"Oh, Rat Man!"</i>

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:48.610
<i>"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:49.610
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.800
Yuna-chan, what's wrong?

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:02.230
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:04.290
-I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
-Yuna.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:10.960
Thank you.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.450
It looks like there's a lot.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:21.950
Thanks.

00:13:22.390 --> 00:13:26.630
"My friend suddenly fell into a coma
and won't wake up.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:30.440
They don't know why. Please help."

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:31.650
Huh?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:33.630
This one too...

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:38.680
They all say the same thing.
And they're all from the same town.

00:13:38.680 --> 00:13:40.070
Hmm...

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:43.830
So something must be happening
in that town.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:55.990
I'm home.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:59.240
Oh, Yuna-chan, welcome home.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.330
Oh, excuse me.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:05.620
This is Watanabe-san. He's my co-worker.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:06.920
Good evening.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.940
Good... evening.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:14.960
Watanabe-san has said
he'd like to date me.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.470
Huh?!

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:20.390
I thought it'd just be the two of us,
Yuna-chan,

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:24.100
but people can't survive without love.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.100
That's what I thought!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:31.360
That's when I realized that
I've been too hard on you, Yuna-chan.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:37.110
But you're a girl after all, Yuna-chan.
You'd like a relationship or two, right?

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.700
So, how are things?

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:42.040
Are you dating Uchida-kun?
You should invite him over some time.

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.790
He's your childhood friend
and he's earnest. He's perfect for you.

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.630
Oh! You two kissed didn't you?

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:49.620
Are you joking?!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:56.630
Do you have any idea what I've gone
through trying to obey your rules, Mom?

00:14:57.780 --> 00:14:59.450
Yuna-chan...

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:03.640
How dare you!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:07.900
How dare you do that after all this time!
I won't forgive you!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:11.100
Stop it, Yuna-chan! Stop it!

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:25.790
Is this girl the <i>yokai</i>?

00:15:25.790 --> 00:15:26.720
No.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.480
It's this.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.150
Stop!

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:39.280
Gahi-san...

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:44.320
Without Gahi-san, I...

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.010
Yuna-chan!

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.920
There's nowhere to run!

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:01.870
Kitaro, that's the Gahi,
a <i>yokai</i> that feeds on human souls.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:05.540
The picture scroll that
Sand Witch was talking about...

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:07.430
Must have been him.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:14.560
Gahi-san!

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:18.230
Defeat this guy!

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:22.430
He's a <i>yokai</i> that feeds on human souls!

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.930
Don't you know that?!

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.970
I know that already.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:31.730
But Gahi-san is all that I have left!

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.150
R-Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.540
You bastard...

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:56.770
You dare... You dare scar my face!

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:00.110
Come forth, scroll!

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.820
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.100
Y-Yuna!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.210
Come here...

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.920
Get this <i>chanchanko</i> off of me!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:20.610
No! Don't go!

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:25.360
Hurry! Get it off me, Yuna!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.550
Yuna-chan!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.750
Mom...

00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:37.290
Yuna-chan, let's go home.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:38.380
Come on.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.820
Get out of the way!

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:44.110
Mom!

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.990
Yuna-chan, help me!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:50.140
Help me!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.140
Yuna-chan!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.270
M-Mom...

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:56.370
Yuna!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.400
Help me!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.900
You desperately obeyed
your mother's rules...

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.300
Yet she betrayed you!

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.010
She does not deserve saving!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:12.140
Yuna-chan!

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:15.290
Remember what your mother did!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:17.830
I-I...

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.440
My mother...

00:18:21.360 --> 00:18:22.880
Yuna-chan.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.420
Yuna-chan.

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:27.970
Yuna-chan.

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:30.510
Yuna-chan.

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:33.560
I'm gonna catch you!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.830
I got you!

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.990
Y-Yuna-chan!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:18:59.750
I remembered...

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:03.770
why I've always obeyed you, Mom.

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:06.990
It's because you're very important to me.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:08.780
And because I loved you.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:12.990
Because I didn't want to hurt you.

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:14.760
Yuna-chan...

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:16.950
Mom...

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.390
What rubbish!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.750
You're nothing but
a shallow human after all.

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.250
GAHI

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.630
That's the Gahi's true form?!

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:40.770
Yuna!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.750
I'll consume your soul
along with your mother's!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.380
Poison Sand!

00:19:53.240 --> 00:19:54.600
Are you okay, Kitaro?

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.930
Sand Witch.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.850
Curse you!

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.830
I'll get you for that!

00:20:10.690 --> 00:20:12.180
Hair Needles!

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.910
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:23.750
Finger Guns!

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.370
Where are we?

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.570
Yuna-chan, I'm sorry for everything.

00:20:51.940 --> 00:20:56.950
I was so selfish.
I was a terrible mother...

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.540
Mom.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:03.720
I love you, Mom.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.060
But...

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:15.590
I won't be your slave anymore.

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.620
This incident made me realize,

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.440
I can't let myself be anyone's slave.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.420
Sure, it's easier.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:32.090
But, as hard as it is,
I have to decide what's right for myself.

00:21:32.510 --> 00:21:34.220
That's why, Mom...

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:37.740
don't worry about me and find happiness.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:40.890
Yuna-chan.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:57.260
We came to check up on them,
but it looks like there was no need.

00:21:57.260 --> 00:21:58.640
It looks like it.

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:01.230
Okay. Let's go home, Kitaro.

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:03.200
Yes, Dad.

